OL,5,G1000 Martin Clunes: Heavy Horsepower
OL,6,     FThe Doc Martin star follows
OL,7,     Fhumans' relationship with horses
OL,8,     Fthrough the ages, exploring the
OL,9,     Fanimal's role in warfare,
OL,10,     Fceremony, farming, transport,
OL,11,     Fsport and leisure.
OL,12,G1100 Martin Clunes: Last Lemur Standing
OL,13,     FMartin travels to Berenty Reserve
OL,14,     Fin Madagascar, home to six species
OL,15,     Fof lemur, and discovers the
OL,16,     Fcrucial role that local guides and
OL,17,     Fvolunteers play in protecting the
OL,18,     Fwildlife.
