OL,10,     Fthe trade in illegal pets and
OL,11,     Fmeeting a crocodile hunter.
OL,12,G1500 Operation Arctic with Simon Reeve
OL,13,     FThe Battle for the Arctic: Every
OL,14,     FAutumn, polar bears gather on the
OL,15,     Fshores of Hudson Bay in Canada to
OL,16,     Fwait for the sea ice to form so
OL,17,     Fthey can begin their winter hunt.
